    {
      "source_file": "corpus/zh/menu/hsfc-overviews.json",
      "target_id": "hsfc-overview:026",
      "current_translation": "　自治都市福特塞班与月之民对峙。\n受雇前来助阵的和平号，\n终于与卡洛德重逢。",
      "translation_sha256": "a90e50870338cf06fe7ee102f5a13bcd5f3ea909ea6610098faafa61d6fa8ea3",
      "status": "pending_unified_writeback"
    },
    {
      "source_file": "corpus/zh/menu/stage-overviews.json",
      "target_id": "overview:022",
      "current_translation": "　迪安娜回归军把北美自治都市福特塞文选作月之民\n回归地，然而这并非迪安娜本意，而是军方暴走。\n　卡利斯雇来和平号与之对抗。\n　钢铁齿轮一行与弗罗斯特兄弟率领的新联邦军\n也先后出现，战场陷入混乱。假扮姬艾尔的\n迪安娜试图与假扮迪安娜的姬艾尔再次换回身份。\n　交换身份虽然失败，福特塞文却得以保住。\n　但这场败仗使迪安娜回归军内部的军方暴走变得更加严重。\n",
      "translation_sha256": "6035634e73c3435d119de0b4f254e2e3be22b8dc1f8b2507d04f01a3adb5f5fb",
      "status": "pending_unified_writeback"
    },
    {
      "source_file": "corpus/zh/story-dialogue/stage-027.json",
      "target_id": "story/027/dialogue/01.01/0000",
      "current_translation": "“迪安娜回归军仍在接近福特塞班市。”",
      "translation_sha256": "20a9538836824a2a89a560ad170f21f39778b437fa528fe97da877ef678bd737",
      "status": "pending_unified_writeback"
    },
    {
      "source_file": "corpus/zh/story-dialogue/stage-027.json",
      "target_id": "story/027/dialogue/01.01/0002",
      "current_translation": "“各位……如果我们被突破，\n　福特塞班就会暴露在敌人的攻击下。”",
      "translation_sha256": "c0b365ae243810d3227f44d12d3e4049b19d3e8a94857353e97cf0d7b3c1e264",
      "status": "pending_unified_writeback"
    },
    {
      "source_file": "corpus/zh/story-dialogue/stage-027.json",
      "target_id": "story/027/dialogue/01.05/0004",
      "current_translation": "“全军，开始攻击！\n　为了月之民的回归，拿下福特塞班！”",
      "translation_sha256": "1b1cac8899398f0c331f1e005edcbdf2b5013698b4d70b364d0c2f2fca614cfc",
      "status": "pending_unified_writeback"
    },
    {
      "source_file": "corpus/zh/story-dialogue/stage-027.json",
      "target_id": "story/027/dialogue/01.08/0004",
      "current_translation": "“全军，开始攻击！\n　为了月之民的回归，拿下福特塞班！”",
      "translation_sha256": "1b1cac8899398f0c331f1e005edcbdf2b5013698b4d70b364d0c2f2fca614cfc",
      "status": "pending_unified_writeback"
    },
    {
      "source_file": "corpus/zh/story-dialogue/stage-027.json",
      "target_id": "story/027/dialogue/01.15/0009",
      "current_translation": "“福特塞班自卫团的各位，\n　英格利萨民兵团，现在到达！”",
      "translation_sha256": "fd2ddacefc9ec7714c60ccccbf87dac242250d708a6d375a9e54887b00542903",
      "status": "pending_unified_writeback"
    },
    {
      "source_file": "corpus/zh/story-dialogue/stage-027.json",
      "target_id": "story/027/dialogue/01.15/0011",
      "current_translation": "“听到福特塞班我就想会不会是……\n　果然是你，卡利斯！”",
      "translation_sha256": "10e4e6165d916801802b3ce2228d5dc837a6be26da3393d54569824da77424f1",
      "status": "pending_unified_writeback"
    },
    {
      "source_file": "corpus/zh/story-dialogue/stage-027.json",
      "target_id": "story/027/dialogue/01.28/0005",
      "current_translation": "“本想趁混乱拿下福特塞班，\n　但发现了意外的猎物。”",
      "translation_sha256": "82495256323b902a1478821ed7d05920f45acc10cc5c4c931878b05ebc848c17",
      "status": "pending_unified_writeback"
    },
    {
      "source_file": "corpus/zh/story-dialogue/stage-027.json",
      "target_id": "story/027/dialogue/01.28/0007",
      "current_translation": "“好机会。连同福特塞班的\n　新人类研究资料一起收下吧。”",
      "translation_sha256": "f41a1974d3402846a3a05a39181c956810e3a8702d6ea5c5aa8754786c3d886c",
      "status": "pending_unified_writeback"
    },
    {
      "source_file": "corpus/zh/story-dialogue/stage-027.json",
      "target_id": "story/027/dialogue/01.28/0009",
      "current_translation": "“致新联邦军。\n　我是福特塞班自卫团代表卡利斯·诺提拉斯。”",
      "translation_sha256": "4afa0fc2da6db13728b7b74b5c69dbed65ff547c6f86ad602b726fee099890a9",
      "status": "pending_unified_writeback"
    },
    {
      "source_file": "corpus/zh/story-dialogue/stage-027.json",
      "target_id": "story/027/dialogue/01.50/0000",
      "current_translation": "“这个福特塞班是我们的城市。”",
      "translation_sha256": "a009261814dd0e2a45673625fa049ac6d39edd1d257cd20c40f27c5bc069aeaf",
      "status": "pending_unified_writeback"
    },
    {
      "source_file": "corpus/zh/story-dialogue/stage-027.json",
      "target_id": "story/027/dialogue/02.01/0007",
      "current_translation": "“迪安娜回归军似乎在福特塞班\n　以西40公里处设立了基地营地。”",
      "translation_sha256": "77f4ebbc5f02e43b62a1857769cbf45d7aab15459f0b4d0fc31baf61ef62bf33",
      "status": "pending_unified_writeback"
    },
    {
      "source_file": "corpus/zh/story-dialogue/stage-027.json",
      "target_id": "story/027/dialogue/02.01/0009",
      "current_translation": "“舰长……\n　月之民打算用武力压制这个福特塞班吗？”",
      "translation_sha256": "74e761be09bd827b97521d77e43d4e47acc6c5ce38153e15176d5681f9f73a46",
      "status": "pending_unified_writeback"
    },
    {
      "source_file": "corpus/zh/story-dialogue/stage-027.json",
      "target_id": "story/027/dialogue/02.01/0013",
      "current_translation": "“瞄准福特塞班这样的自治城市，\n　做法也太小家子气了。”",
      "translation_sha256": "42f5a95bd960f9ee8361f0623177ac8a3f95e0d611d5c48b9ffb9b352f030e3c",
      "status": "pending_unified_writeback"
    },
    {
      "source_file": "corpus/zh/story-dialogue/stage-027.json",
      "target_id": "story/027/dialogue/02.01/0048",
      "current_translation": "“……向福特塞班派遣了迪安娜回归军？”",
      "translation_sha256": "4fc6998e8e0361bdb54bab53e1facb0b52920c36ded6a63328a8132bd3ab1bc0",
      "status": "pending_unified_writeback"
    },
    {
      "source_file": "corpus/zh/story-dialogue/stage-027.json",
      "target_id": "story/027/dialogue/02.01/0050",
      "current_translation": "“什么意思，菲尔少校？\n　我说过想和福特塞班的领导人举行会谈。”",
      "translation_sha256": "bacc2bdfa7cb02192179d9aeb7db44b238346e412448d88fcc36ac982d14f38d",
      "status": "pending_unified_writeback"
    },
    {
      "source_file": "corpus/zh/story-dialogue/stage-027.json",
      "target_id": "story/027/dialogue/02.01/0053",
      "current_translation": "“您生气也是理所当然。但这对与福特\n　塞班方面的谈判，想必也是一种助力。”",
      "translation_sha256": "4915d5129dfdd939f060058735b49295b2c0d07304561a47fa45b789c7630aed",
      "status": "pending_unified_writeback"
    },
    {
      "source_file": "corpus/zh/story-dialogue/stage-027.json",
      "target_id": "story/027/dialogue/02.01/0103",
      "current_translation": "“各员，保持原地听令。\n　菲尔少校下达了向福特塞班市进攻的命令。”",
      "translation_sha256": "ec981ce088d255a61cebf72126403550f2459924c83b8f8c794e66292a681950",
      "status": "pending_unified_writeback"
    },
    {
      "source_file": "corpus/zh/story-dialogue/stage-027.json",
      "target_id": "story/027/dialogue/02.01/0106",
      "current_translation": "“福特塞班也有自卫团。但以迪安娜回归军\n　的荣誉为赌注，绝不允许落后。”",
      "translation_sha256": "c96609f37cecb25963075621a0f566c1b6a034405a633971ec6619d0e7f85d2b",
      "status": "pending_unified_writeback"
    },
    {
      "source_file": "corpus/zh/story-dialogue/stage-027.json",
      "target_id": "story/027/dialogue/02.01/0143",
      "current_translation": "“那样的话，\n　加入福特塞班的自卫团也是一种方法吧？”",
      "translation_sha256": "020ceb52afd595cd72107d427f714b1c162e77a6a561c7367301c9f55e65679f",
      "status": "pending_unified_writeback"
    },
    {
      "source_file": "corpus/zh/story-dialogue/stage-027.json",
      "target_id": "story/027/dialogue/02.01/0151",
      "current_translation": "“各员，保持原地听令。\n　菲尔少校下达了向福特塞班市进攻的命令。”",
      "translation_sha256": "ec981ce088d255a61cebf72126403550f2459924c83b8f8c794e66292a681950",
      "status": "pending_unified_writeback"
    },
    {
      "source_file": "corpus/zh/story-dialogue/stage-027.json",
      "target_id": "story/027/dialogue/02.01/0154",
      "current_translation": "“福特塞班也有自卫团。但以迪安娜回归军\n　的荣誉为赌注，绝不允许落后。”",
      "translation_sha256": "c96609f37cecb25963075621a0f566c1b6a034405a633971ec6619d0e7f85d2b",
      "status": "pending_unified_writeback"
    },
    {
      "source_file": "corpus/zh/story-dialogue/stage-027.json",
      "target_id": "story/027/dialogue/02.01/0207",
      "current_translation": "“那你怎么不去加入福特塞文的警备团？”",
      "translation_sha256": "349840b88ae2b64293891bbc87b5d9c295d8a28548274459f94ef83c4eeeda1d",
      "status": "pending_unified_writeback"
    },
    {
      "source_file": "corpus/zh/story-dialogue/stage-027.json",
      "target_id": "story/027/dialogue/02.02/0003",
      "current_translation": "“前往福特塞文的部队全灭了？”",
      "translation_sha256": "8015fc883fde1e81ddd1686a989c98592e7fd4f372802c285908d05baa580971",
      "status": "pending_unified_writeback"
    },
    {
      "source_file": "corpus/zh/story-dialogue/stage-027.json",
      "target_id": "story/027/dialogue/02.02/0030",
      "current_translation": "“迪安娜大人……刚才在福特塞文的战斗……”",
      "translation_sha256": "aae1886603340fe4da50260e863954e3a44ef1a46176dbe9763b45d4ef73ef23",
      "status": "pending_unified_writeback"
    },
    {
      "source_file": "corpus/zh/story-dialogue/stage-027.json",
      "target_id": "story/027/dialogue/02.02/0055",
      "current_translation": "“算是吧。然后经过各种事，\n　在福特塞文受了卡利斯的照顾。”",
      "translation_sha256": "9a7aa3d1dd031673e28cde312119d54627036cdb86a1a80575d2ec28c73a8c4e",
      "status": "pending_unified_writeback"
    },
    {
      "source_file": "corpus/zh/story-dialogue/stage-027.json",
      "target_id": "story/027/dialogue/02.02/0117",
      "current_translation": "“……我只是在梦里看到的。\n　在福特塞文遇到的人，稍微未来一点的事……”",
      "translation_sha256": "b17fca8305b50e5e966dff2260f53100b375df83bfb3c5f9a326a49b2de403e3",
      "status": "pending_unified_writeback"
    },
    {
      "source_file": "corpus/zh/story-dialogue/stage-061.json",
      "target_id": "story/061/dialogue/01.34/0001",
      "current_translation": "“怎么回事！？\n　和在塞瓦堡战斗时动作完全不同！”",
      "translation_sha256": "2c61ffc57cf10cb6f7b307d5abb334743be3543d51f5d4888bd0306a80744d98",
      "status": "pending_unified_writeback"
    },
    {
      "source_file": "corpus/zh/story-dialogue/stage-076.json",
      "target_id": "story/076/dialogue/01.09/0002",
      "current_translation": "“没错！\n　是在塞瓦堡战斗过的革命军的MA！！”",
      "translation_sha256": "8c8adc6e860fbb9e4d48facbb14e3c96e22d5bcb7dcc5d03e94b6db7e697290c",
      "status": "pending_unified_writeback"
    },
    {
      "source_file": "corpus/zh/story-dialogue/stage-109.json",
      "target_id": "story/109/dialogue/02.03/0157",
      "current_translation": "“$c，请回答。\n　这里是福特塞文的卡利斯·诺提拉斯。”",
      "translation_sha256": "a4630a0a0abd8cdb9462ed2d26a4c5baa1bcb8140580133d4f609ac58c8d11e8",
      "status": "pending_unified_writeback"
    },
    {
      "source_file": "corpus/zh/story-dialogue/stage-135.json",
      "target_id": "story/135/dialogue/02.01/0120",
      "current_translation": "“您不仅是月之女王，还受奥布等独立国\n　以及福特塞文等自治都市委托了代表权。”",
      "translation_sha256": "c21b58c6027e8c8c054b599e5f6a2d44db301ec7d5a10474fcc1d358b17b1d7f",
      "status": "pending_unified_writeback"
    },
    {
      "source_file": "corpus/zh/story-dialogue/stage-138.json",
      "target_id": "story/138/dialogue/02.01/0121",
      "current_translation": "“您不仅是月之女王，还受奥布等独立国\n　以及福特塞文等自治都市委托了代表权。”",
      "translation_sha256": "c21b58c6027e8c8c054b599e5f6a2d44db301ec7d5a10474fcc1d358b17b1d7f",
